{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "WSM6IceDeposition",
    "description": "Vapor-exchange and conversion process rates of the ice phase of the WRF single-moment 6-class microphysics scheme (WSM6; Hong and Lim 2006; Hong, Dudhia and Chen 2004), transcribed from the cold-rain block of mp_wsm6_run in phys/physics_mmm/mp_wsm6.F90 (WRF 4.8, NCAR/MMM-physics): deposition/sublimation of vapor on cloud ice (pidep, HDC eq. 9), snow (psdep, HDC eq. 14) and graupel (pgdep, HL A21) below 0 C; ice nucleation from vapor (pigen, HDC eqs. 7-8); aggregation of ice to snow (psaut, HDC eq. 12) and of snow to graupel (pgaut, LFO eq. 37); and evaporation of melting snow (psevp, HL A35) and graupel (pgevp, HL A25) above 0 C. The UNLIMITED rates are the physics: pidep = 4 D_i N_i (rh_i - 1)/F_i, psdep/pgdep/psevp/pgevp the ventilated diffusional growth (rh - 1)(c1 lambda^-2 + c2 f_v coeres)/F, pgaut = alpha2(T) max(0, qs - qs0). Two processes are instantaneous adjustments that the kernel writes as rates: nucleation relaxes the ice content to the target q_i0(T) = 4.92e-11 N_i0(T)^1.33/rho and ice-to-snow aggregation removes the excess of q_i over q_imax = 2.08e22 D_max^8/rho; here the physical quantities are the targets q_i0 and q_imax (observeds qi_nucleation_target, qi_max) and the rates pigen, psaut carry the sub-step dtcld as a parameter (FORTRAN_BUGS.md N3). WSM6 limits the deposition processes SEQUENTIALLY against the vapor budget: after the rain evaporation prevp of the warm-rain block (an INPUT here, from warm_rain.esm), each of pidep, psdep, pgdep may take at most half the supersaturation over ice per sub-step (satdt/2) and at most what the earlier processes left (supice), a sublimating species may not lose more than it holds, and once the running sum of the limited rates reaches satdt the flag ifsat closes the remaining processes and the nucleation; that chain is transcribed pointwise as the <rate>_lim observeds and the ifsat_* indicators, all time-step artefacts kept apart from the physics. The saturation state over water and ice (qsat_w, rh_w, qsat_i, rh_i, xl) is an INPUT from saturation.esm evaluated at the start of the sub-step (FORTRAN_BUGS.md N4); the size distributions, N_i, D_i come from hydrometeor_slopes.esm mounted as subsystem `sd`; the deposition coefficients precs1/2, precg1/2 live there too; the diffusional-growth denominators over water and ice and the ventilation factor are computed here with the same templates as warm_rain.esm from lib/wrf_air_properties.esm. Constants: wsm6_parameters.esm (`par`), lib/wrf_constants.esm (`wrf`). Consumer-supplied inputs are the rewrite-target ops `input_<name>` lowered in the inline tests through a per-test template library generated by tools/fill_tests.py from the instrumented WRF dumps.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": ["wrf", "microphysics", "wsm6", "deposition", "nucleation", "ice-phase", "column"],
    "references": [
      { "citation": "Hong, S.-Y., J. Dudhia, and S.-H. Chen (2004). A revised approach to ice microphysical processes for the bulk parameterization of clouds and precipitation. Mon. Wea. Rev. 132, 103-120 (eqs. 7-9, 12-14).", "doi": "10.1175/1520-0493(2004)132<0103:ARATIM>2.0.CO;2" },
      { "citation": "Hong, S.-Y., and J.-O. J. Lim (2006). The WRF single-moment 6-class microphysics scheme (WSM6). J. Korean Meteor. Soc. 42, 129-151 (appendix A eqs. A4, A21, A25, A35, eq. 50)." },
      { "citation": "Lin, Y.-L., R. D. Farley, and H. D. Orville (1983). Bulk parameterization of the snow field in a cloud model. J. Climate Appl. Meteor. 22, 1065-1092 (eqs. 37, 46)." },
      { "citation": "Rutledge, S. A., and P. V. Hobbs (1983). The mesoscale and microscale structure and organization of clouds and precipitation in midlatitude cyclones. VIII. J. Atmos. Sci. 40, 1185-1206 (eq. A27)." },
      { "citation": "NCAR/MMM-physics mp_wsm6.F90 at commit 550b5b4 (WRF 4.8 phys/physics_mmm submodule), cold-rain block lines 1142-1245; diffac, venfac helper functions." }
    ]
  },
  "models": {
    "WSM6IceDeposition": {
      "expression_template_imports": [ { "ref": "../../../lib/wrf_air_properties.esm" }, { "ref": "./microphysics_templates.esm" } ],
      "subsystems": {
        "wrf": { "ref": "../../../lib/wrf_constants.esm" },
        "par": { "ref": "./wsm6_parameters.esm" },
        "sd": { "ref": "./hydrometeor_slopes.esm" }
      },
      "variables": {
        "qv": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Water-vapor mixing ratio (WSM6 q)." },
        "p": { "type": "unknown", "units": "Pa", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Pressure." },
        "qsat_w": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Saturation mixing ratio over water at the start-of-step state (saturation.esm)." },
        "rh_w": { "type": "unknown", "units": "1", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Relative humidity over water at the start-of-step state (saturation.esm)." },
        "qsat_i": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Saturation mixing ratio over ice at the start-of-step state (saturation.esm)." },
        "rh_i": { "type": "unknown", "units": "1", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Relative humidity over ice at the start-of-step state (saturation.esm)." },
        "xl": { "type": "unknown", "units": "J/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Latent heat of vaporization at the start-of-step temperature (saturation.esm)." },
        "prevp": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Rain evaporation/condensation rate as applied by the kernel (warm_rain.esm prevp_lim); the first entry of the sequential vapor budget." },
        "dtcld": { "type": "parameter", "units": "s", "default": 60.0, "description": "Length of the WSM6 sub-time step; enters the limiters and the adjustment rates only." },
        "roqimax": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/m^3", "description": "Maximum ice content rho q_imax = 2.08e22 D_max^8 before aggregation to snow (WSM6 roqimax)." },
        "supcol": { "type": "unknown", "units": "K", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Supercooling T0 - T (WSM6 supcol)." },
        "supsat": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Supersaturation over ice, max(qv, qmin) - qsat_i (WSM6 supsat)." },
        "satdt": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Supersaturation over ice per sub-step, supsat/dtcld (WSM6 satdt)." },
        "nu": { "type": "unknown", "units": "m^2/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Kinematic viscosity of air (WSM6 viscos)." },
        "Dv": { "type": "unknown", "units": "m^2/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Diffusivity of water vapor in air (WSM6 diffus)." },
        "ka": { "type": "unknown", "units": "W/(m*K)", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Thermal conductivity of air (WSM6 xka)." },
        "f_diff_w": { "type": "unknown", "units": "s/m^2", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Diffusional-growth denominator over water, rho xl^2/(ka r_v T^2) + 1/(qsat_w Dv) (WSM6 work1(:,:,1))." },
        "f_diff_i": { "type": "unknown", "units": "s/m^2", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Diffusional-growth denominator over ice with the sublimation enthalpy xls (WSM6 work1(:,:,2))." },
        "f_vent": { "type": "unknown", "units": "s^(1/2)/m", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Ventilation factor (WSM6 work2)." },
        "coeres_s": { "type": "unknown", "units": "m^(141/50)", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Ventilation moment of the snow distribution lambda_s^-2 (lambda_s^-1 lambda_s^-bvts)^(1/2) (WSM6 coeres for snow); units for bvts = 0.41." },
        "coeres_g": { "type": "unknown", "units": "m^(29/10)", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Ventilation moment of the graupel distribution (WSM6 coeres for graupel); units for bvtg = 0.8." },
        "pidep": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Deposition (positive) / sublimation of vapor on cloud ice below 0 C (HDC 9), unlimited; zero without ice or above 0 C." },
        "supice_i": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Vapor budget left for cloud ice after rain evaporation, satdt - prevp (WSM6 supice before pidep)." },
        "pidep_lim": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "pidep after the sequential saturation limiter (WSM6 pidep as applied)." },
        "ifsat_i": { "type": "unknown", "units": "1", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "1 where |prevp + pidep_lim| >= |satdt| has closed the vapor budget (WSM6 ifsat after pidep), else 0." },
        "psdep": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Deposition / sublimation of vapor on snow below 0 C (HDC 14), n0s(T)/n0s (rh_i - 1)(precs1 lambda_s^-2 + precs2 f_v coeres_s)/F_i, unlimited." },
        "supice_s": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Vapor budget left for snow, satdt - prevp - pidep_lim." },
        "psdep_lim": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "psdep after the sequential saturation limiter; zero where ifsat_i has closed the budget (WSM6 psdep as applied)." },
        "ifsat_s": { "type": "unknown", "units": "1", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "1 where the budget is closed after psdep (WSM6 ifsat after psdep)." },
        "pgdep": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Deposition / sublimation of vapor on graupel below 0 C (HL A21, LFO 46), unlimited." },
        "supice_g": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Vapor budget left for graupel, satdt - prevp - pidep_lim - psdep_lim." },
        "pgdep_lim": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "pgdep after the sequential saturation limiter; zero where ifsat_s has closed the budget (WSM6 pgdep as applied)." },
        "ifsat_g": { "type": "unknown", "units": "1", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "1 where the budget is closed after pgdep (WSM6 ifsat after pgdep)." },
        "supice_n": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Vapor budget left for nucleation, satdt - prevp - pidep_lim - psdep_lim - pgdep_lim." },
        "qi_nucleation_target": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Ice mixing ratio the nucleation relaxes towards, q_i0(T) = 4.92e-11 (1e3 exp(0.1 (T0 - T)))^1.33/rho (HDC 7-8; WSM6 roqi0/den)." },
        "pigen": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Ice nucleation rate max(0, (q_i0 - q_i)/dtcld) below 0 C where supersaturated over ice (HL 50, HDC 7-8): an adjustment written as a rate, so it scales with 1/dtcld." },
        "pigen_lim": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "pigen after the vapor-budget limiter min(pigen, satdt, supice_n); zero where ifsat_g has closed the budget (WSM6 pigen as applied)." },
        "qi_max": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Maximum ice mixing ratio before aggregation to snow, roqimax/rho (HDC 13; WSM6 qimax)." },
        "psaut": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Aggregation of cloud ice to snow, max(0, (q_i - q_imax)/dtcld) below 0 C (HDC 12): an adjustment written as a rate (WSM6 psaut, no further limiter)." },
        "pgaut": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Aggregation of snow to graupel below 0 C, 1e-3 exp(-0.09 (T0 - T)) max(0, qs - qs0) (LFO 37, HL A4), unlimited." },
        "pgaut_lim": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "pgaut after the limiter min(pgaut, qs/dtcld)." },
        "psevp": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Evaporation of melting snow above 0 C where subsaturated over water (HL A35, RH83 A27), n0s(T)/n0s (rh_w - 1)(precs1 lambda_s^-2 + precs2 f_v coeres_s)/F_w (negative), unlimited." },
        "psevp_lim": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "psevp after the limiter min(max(psevp, -qs/dtcld), 0)." },
        "pgevp": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Evaporation of melting graupel above 0 C where subsaturated over water (HL A25, RH84 A19), unlimited." },
        "pgevp_lim": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "pgevp after the limiter min(max(pgevp, -qg/dtcld), 0)." }
      },
      "equations": [
        { "lhs": "qv", "rhs": { "op": "input_qv", "args": [] } },
        { "lhs": "p", "rhs": { "op": "input_p", "args": [] } },
        { "lhs": "qsat_w", "rhs": { "op": "input_qsat_w", "args": [] } },
        { "lhs": "rh_w", "rhs": { "op": "input_rh_w", "args": [] } },
        { "lhs": "qsat_i", "rhs": { "op": "input_qsat_i", "args": [] } },
        { "lhs": "rh_i", "rhs": { "op": "input_rh_i", "args": [] } },
        { "lhs": "xl", "rhs": { "op": "input_xl", "args": [] } },
        { "lhs": "prevp", "rhs": { "op": "input_prevp", "args": [] } },
        { "lhs": "roqimax", "rhs": { "op": "*", "args": ["par.roqimax_coef", { "op": "^", "args": ["par.dimax", "par.roqimax_exp"] }] } },
        { "lhs": "supcol", "rhs": { "op": "-", "args": ["wrf.svpt0", "sd.T"] } },
        { "lhs": "supsat", "rhs": { "op": "-", "args": [{ "op": "max", "args": ["qv", "par.qmin"] }, "qsat_i"] } },
        { "lhs": "satdt", "rhs": { "op": "/", "args": ["supsat", "dtcld"] } },
        { "lhs": "nu", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "kinematic_viscosity_of_air", "bindings": { "T": "sd.T", "rho": "sd.rho", "coef": "par.viscos_coef", "T_sutherland": "par.sutherland_T" } } },
        { "lhs": "Dv", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "diffusivity_of_water_vapor", "bindings": { "T": "sd.T", "p": "p", "coef": "par.diffus_coef", "expn": "par.diffus_exp" } } },
        { "lhs": "ka", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "thermal_conductivity_of_air", "bindings": { "nu": "nu", "rho": "sd.rho", "coef": "par.xka_coef" } } },
        { "lhs": "f_diff_w", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "diffusional_growth_denominator", "bindings": { "L": "xl", "T": "sd.T", "rho": "sd.rho", "ka": "ka", "r_v": "wrf.r_v", "qsat": "qsat_w", "Dv": "Dv" } } },
        { "lhs": "f_diff_i", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "diffusional_growth_denominator", "bindings": { "L": "wrf.xls", "T": "sd.T", "rho": "sd.rho", "ka": "ka", "r_v": "wrf.r_v", "qsat": "qsat_i", "Dv": "Dv" } } },
        { "lhs": "f_vent", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "ventilation_factor", "bindings": { "nu": "nu", "Dv": "Dv", "rho": "sd.rho", "rho0": "wrf.rhoair0" } } },
        { "lhs": "coeres_s", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "ventilation_slope_factor", "bindings": { "rslope": "sd.rslope_s", "rslopeb": "sd.rslopeb_s", "rslope2": "sd.rslope2_s" } } },
        { "lhs": "coeres_g", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "ventilation_slope_factor", "bindings": { "rslope": "sd.rslope_g", "rslopeb": "sd.rslopeb_g", "rslope2": "sd.rslope2_g" } } },
        { "lhs": "pidep", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["supcol", 0] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qi", 0] }] },
            { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "ice_deposition_rate", "bindings": { "D": "sd.D_i", "xni": "sd.xni", "rh_i": "rh_i", "f_diff_i": "f_diff_i" } },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "supice_i", "rhs": { "op": "-", "args": ["satdt", "prevp"] } },
        { "lhs": "pidep_lim", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["supcol", 0] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qi", 0] }] },
            { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "saturation_limited_deposition", "bindings": { "rate": "pidep", "satdt": "satdt", "supice": "supice_i", "q": "sd.qi", "dt": "dtcld" } },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "ifsat_i", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [{ "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["supcol", 0] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qi", 0] }, { "op": ">=", "args": [{ "op": "abs", "args": [{ "op": "+", "args": ["prevp", "pidep_lim"] }] }, { "op": "abs", "args": ["satdt"] }] }] }, 1, 0] } },
        { "lhs": "psdep", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["supcol", 0] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qs", 0] }] },
            { "op": "*", "args": ["sd.n0sfac", { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "ventilated_diffusional_growth", "bindings": { "rh": "rh_i", "rslope2": "sd.rslope2_s", "coeres": "coeres_s", "f_vent": "f_vent", "f_diff": "f_diff_i", "c1": "sd.precs1", "c2": "sd.precs2" } }] },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "supice_s", "rhs": { "op": "-", "args": ["supice_i", "pidep_lim"] } },
        { "lhs": "psdep_lim", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["supcol", 0] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qs", 0] }, { "op": "==", "args": ["ifsat_i", 0] }] },
            { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "saturation_limited_deposition", "bindings": { "rate": "psdep", "satdt": "satdt", "supice": "supice_s", "q": "sd.qs", "dt": "dtcld" } },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "ifsat_s", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [{ "op": "or", "args": [{ "op": "==", "args": ["ifsat_i", 1] }, { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["supcol", 0] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qs", 0] }, { "op": ">=", "args": [{ "op": "abs", "args": [{ "op": "+", "args": ["prevp", "pidep_lim", "psdep_lim"] }] }, { "op": "abs", "args": ["satdt"] }] }] }] }, 1, 0] } },
        { "lhs": "pgdep", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["supcol", 0] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qg", 0] }] },
            { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "ventilated_diffusional_growth", "bindings": { "rh": "rh_i", "rslope2": "sd.rslope2_g", "coeres": "coeres_g", "f_vent": "f_vent", "f_diff": "f_diff_i", "c1": "sd.precg1", "c2": "sd.precg2" } },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "supice_g", "rhs": { "op": "-", "args": ["supice_s", "psdep_lim"] } },
        { "lhs": "pgdep_lim", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["supcol", 0] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qg", 0] }, { "op": "==", "args": ["ifsat_s", 0] }] },
            { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "saturation_limited_deposition", "bindings": { "rate": "pgdep", "satdt": "satdt", "supice": "supice_g", "q": "sd.qg", "dt": "dtcld" } },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "ifsat_g", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [{ "op": "or", "args": [{ "op": "==", "args": ["ifsat_s", 1] }, { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["supcol", 0] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qg", 0] }, { "op": ">=", "args": [{ "op": "abs", "args": [{ "op": "+", "args": ["prevp", "pidep_lim", "psdep_lim", "pgdep_lim"] }] }, { "op": "abs", "args": ["satdt"] }] }] }] }, 1, 0] } },
        { "lhs": "supice_n", "rhs": { "op": "-", "args": ["supice_g", "pgdep_lim"] } },
        { "lhs": "qi_nucleation_target", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "ice_nucleation_target", "bindings": { "T": "sd.T", "t0": "wrf.svpt0", "rho": "sd.rho", "n_coef": "par.xni0_coef", "n_exp": "par.xni0_exp", "m_coef": "par.roqi0_coef", "m_exp": "par.roqi0_exp" } } },
        { "lhs": "pigen", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["supcol", 0] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["supsat", 0] }] },
            { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "adjustment_towards_target_rate", "bindings": { "q_target": "qi_nucleation_target", "q": { "op": "max", "args": ["sd.qi", 0] }, "dt": "dtcld" } },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "pigen_lim", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["supcol", 0] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["supsat", 0] }, { "op": "==", "args": ["ifsat_g", 0] }] },
            { "op": "min", "args": ["pigen", "satdt", "supice_n"] },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "qi_max", "rhs": { "op": "/", "args": ["roqimax", "sd.rho"] } },
        { "lhs": "psaut", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["supcol", 0] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qi", 0] }] },
            { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "excess_conversion_rate", "bindings": { "q": "sd.qi", "q_max": "qi_max", "dt": "dtcld" } },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "pgaut", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["supcol", 0] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qs", 0] }] },
            { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "snow_to_graupel_aggregation", "bindings": { "qs": "sd.qs", "qs0": "par.qs0", "T": "sd.T", "t0": "wrf.svpt0", "coef": "par.pgaut_coef", "expn": "par.pgaut_exp" } },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "pgaut_lim", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "sink_rate_limiter", "bindings": { "rate": "pgaut", "q": "sd.qs", "dt": "dtcld" } } },
        { "lhs": "psevp", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": "<", "args": ["supcol", 0] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qs", 0] }, { "op": "<", "args": ["rh_w", 1] }] },
            { "op": "*", "args": ["sd.n0sfac", { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "ventilated_diffusional_growth", "bindings": { "rh": "rh_w", "rslope2": "sd.rslope2_s", "coeres": "coeres_s", "f_vent": "f_vent", "f_diff": "f_diff_w", "c1": "sd.precs1", "c2": "sd.precs2" } }] },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "psevp_lim", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "negative_sink_limiter", "bindings": { "rate": "psevp", "q": "sd.qs", "dt": "dtcld" } } },
        { "lhs": "pgevp", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": "<", "args": ["supcol", 0] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qg", 0] }, { "op": "<", "args": ["rh_w", 1] }] },
            { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "ventilated_diffusional_growth", "bindings": { "rh": "rh_w", "rslope2": "sd.rslope2_g", "coeres": "coeres_g", "f_vent": "f_vent", "f_diff": "f_diff_w", "c1": "sd.precg1", "c2": "sd.precg2" } },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "pgevp_lim", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "negative_sink_limiter", "bindings": { "rate": "pgevp", "q": "sd.qg", "dt": "dtcld" } } }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "qss_step250_row23_col24_mixed_phase_deposition",
          "description": "Reference: WRF 4.8 em_quarter_ss idealized supercell (GNU real32 build, dx = 2 km, dt = 12 s, 40 layers, WSM6 only) dumped by the instrumented ctessum-claude/WRF fork (module_esm_dump with esm_dump_inner hooks inside mp_wsm6_run of the ctessum-claude/MMM-physics fork, commit 52cfbd7) and replayed through the real64 (kind_phys = real64) standalone kernels/wsm6_driver at the WRF step. POINTWISE and step-free: the inputs are the state at which the kernel evaluates its process rates (t_rates, q/qi/qr/qs/qg_rates after the sub-step's sedimentation, melting, freezing and slope update; den, p; the start-of-sub-step saturation block qsat_w/rh_w/qsat_i/rh_i/xl, see saturation.esm; and the applied rain evaporation prevp_raw of the warm-rain block), the expected values the rates the kernel dumps right after evaluating them (`<rate>_raw`, after the sequential vapor-budget limiters, before the mass-conservation rescaling) and the mp_wsm6_init coefficients, from the real64 replay. No small-dt replay because WSM6's increments are not rate x dt (FORTRAN_BUGS.md N3). Real64 replay vs real32 dump: <= 1e-5 relative in these rates (pidep 1.0 relative only in the near-zero threshold layer 33/34 where a branch flips). Residual esm-vs-real64 mismatch from the kernel's default-real literals and real32 WRF constants (FORTRAN_BUGS.md N2), measured with zero tolerances: pidep 4.8e-8, psdep 1.1e-7, pgdep 0, pgaut 7e-8 of the column maximum; pigen 7.7e-7 because it is the small difference of the nucleation target and the ice content, each carrying the 1e-7 rounding of 4.92e-11, 1.33 and 0.1 (hence rel 5e-6 on its spot checks and Linf 3e-6 of column maximum); psaut up to 1.4e-5 relative on its spot checks because it is the small difference of qi and qimax = roqimax/rho, and roqimax = 2.08e22 dimax^8 carries a 4.3e-7 rounding from the real32 dimax (hence rel 5e-5 on the psaut spot checks; its Linf bound is unaffected). Tolerances otherwise 1e-6 relative on coefficients, absolute Linf bounds on the limited whole columns at 1e-6 of each column's maximum, relative 2e-6 spot checks of the UNLIMITED rates at layers where the dumped rate lies strictly inside every limiter bound (below 0.8 of min(|satdt/2|, |supice|, q/dtcld)). Regime: supercell step 250 (t = 50 min), row j = 23, column i = 24: freezing level at layer 9; ice 9-39, snow 6-33, graupel 1-33; supersaturated over ice (satdt > 0) in layers 3-29, subsaturated above, so pidep/psdep/pgdep change sign near layer 30 and sublimate above; nucleation active 9-29, ice-to-snow aggregation 21-24 (where qi > qimax), snow-to-graupel aggregation 16-28; the vapor budget never closes (ifsat = 0 everywhere); above 0 C the column is saturated over water, so psevp = pgevp = 0.",
          "parameter_overrides": {
            "dtcld": 12.0
          },
